---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Field Notes — Xuanming Zhang"
  description="Field notes on frontier AI mechanisms, cognitive systems, and experiential worlds."
  image="/assets/meta/og-notes.png"
  active="notes"
>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <p class="index-label">Field notes / Research journal</p>
      <h1>Ideas after<br />the paper ends.</h1>
      <p>The mechanisms, failed intuitions, and larger research consequences that do not fit into a conference manuscript.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="notes-list" aria-label="Published field notes">
      <article class="note-feature" data-reveal>
        <figure><img src="/assets/images/metamind-field-note.webp" width="1664" height="928" alt="MetaMind cognitive system visualization" /></figure>
        <div>
          <p class="index-label">Dossier 01 · NeurIPS 2025 Spotlight · English</p>
          <h2>What comes after “more reasoning”?</h2>
          <p>Read the verified technical contribution, then follow the cognitive frontier it opens: latent mental states, metacognitive control, process-level learning, and interactive worlds.</p>
          <div class="note-actions">
            <a class="action action-dark" href="/blog/MetaMind/">Open dossier →</a>
            <a class="action action-outline" href="/blog/MetaMind/technical-contribution/">Technical contribution</a>
            <a class="action action-outline" href="/blog/MetaMind/cognitive-frontier/">Cognitive frontier</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>
    <SiteFooter />
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
